}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Enemy aircraft will not be able to enter any airspace in the Jammer's range and stealth units will be revealed if they try to travel through it.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Sounds pretty awesome. I guess let's get to this.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Yes. A true battle, at last.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "My first chance at a real battle against the Akadians and I have failed. My shame is immeasurable.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Seeing all those planes go down in flames... kind of reminds me of Argent. I hope he's okay.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "He is a capable warrior. He will be fine. I am confident he has dispatched Lieutenant Hayne.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I'm not sure I would go that far.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "You are not confident in your comrade's abilities?", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "He's a fine pilot. He's not really very... well... he's just so Argent, you know?", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "I am afraid I do not know.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Let's just say that there is a lot of whining when he is around.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "There is no whining among the Dragoons.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I've noticed.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "It's actually in the Constitution.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}